# MDM Engine

This is a Databricks / Spark-native Customer MDM Match & Merge project.

Before making substantial changes, read **AGENTS.md** at the repo root — pipeline overview, the golden ID continuity policy, table roles, conventions (no UDFs, no GraphFrames, country-partitioned Delta), current state and open items. `CLAUDE.md` is a short pointer to the same content.

Everything runs on Databricks; there is no supported local workflow. Tests run on a cluster via `notebooks/run_tests.py` (see `docs/TESTING.md`).

Base implementation language is **Python PySpark** under `src/matching/`. Do not replace it with the Scala prototype notebook.
